# ITRS org routing

Topic-first routing for ITRS information sources. Pair with [itrs-engineer.mdc](itrs-engineer.mdc) for engineer stance. Indexes: [reference-itrs-org-routing.md](reference-itrs-org-routing.md).

## Systems and access

| System | Entry | MCP / access |
|--------|-------|----------------|
| Confluence + Jira | Your org Atlassian cloud URL | Atlassian MCP `search` (default); JQL/CQL with your `cloudId` when scoped |
| Slack | itrs.slack.com | `slack_search_public_and_private` (keyword; use `in:#channel`) |
| GitHub org | https://github.com/ITRS-Group | GitHub MCP; org repos read-only per [github-and-remotes.mdc](github-and-remotes.mdc) |
| Public docs | https://docs.itrsgroup.com/docs/ | Web fetch; `/current/` or `/latest/` unless version pinned |
| Support KB | https://support.itrsgroup.com | Web; customer-facing articles |

Also: **devdocs.itrsgroup.com** (internal engineering docs; may need auth). **CA** is ICE (org navigation), not product technical docs.

## Where to look

| Looking for… | 1st | 2nd | 3rd |
|--------------|-----|-----|-----|
| Code in this workspace | This repo | Named `ITRS-Group` repo | ENG Confluence |
| Supported product behaviour | docs.itrsgroup.com | ServiceTeam / ENG Confluence | devdocs |
| Opsview DR / HA / deploy playbooks | ServiceTeam Confluence | `#support-help-opsview` | support.itrsgroup.com |
| Opsview Cloud / IAX SaaS / CPaaS (ITRS-hosted) | CloudOps Confluence | REP Jira | Public IAX/Opsview docs |
| Geneos release / GA process | dev (`Geneos GA*`) | `#geneos-ga-release` | docs.itrsgroup.com/docs/all/ |
| Bugs / fix history | Jira (`OP`, `VI`, `REP`, …) | GitHub links in ticket | Slack thread |
| Recent workaround / who knows | Slack | ServiceTeam | Jira |
| Architecture / eng standards | ENG Confluence | GitHub | Public docs |
| Which Confluence space? | ENG / ServiceTeam / CloudOps overview | Rovo search | CA/ICE overview |

## Access fallbacks

| Signal | Action |
|--------|--------|
| Atlassian auth error or empty results | Note possible missing access; try public docs, repo, GitHub |
| GitHub 404 on private repo | May lack access; try public sibling repo or ask user |
| Slack MCP unavailable | Skip Slack; use Confluence/Jira/repo |
| Only public docs reachable | Use them; flag internal material may exist but was not searchable |

## Excuse → reality

| Excuse | Reality |
|--------|---------|
| "CA/ICE will have the product answer." | CA is corporate navigation; use ENG, ServiceTeam, or CloudOps. |
| "Internal Confluence beats public docs for supported behaviour." | Public docs are authoritative for customer-visible behaviour. |
| "Search failed — nothing exists." | May be access-limited; fall back per table above. |
| "I'll search all of Slack." | Use product channels (`#support-help-opsview`, etc.) and keywords. |
